silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CiteKleisliAnchorSourceKeyExample" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'CiteKleisliAnchorSourceKey', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The local string key \"mittensVetRecord77\" is the input to the cite Kleisli arrow. cite(mittensVetRecord77) = eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) wraps it into the Free(Sigma) monad, producing a single-element witness list. This is the unit embedding of the key into the typed witness object.." .
